        "title": "3-Minute Footwork & Posture Warm-Up",
        "content": "🎁 *Bonus: 3-Minute Kathak Posture & Ankle Warm-Up* 💃\n\n1️⃣ *Samapada Alignment:* Spine straight, shoulders back, feet at 45 degrees.\n2️⃣ *Ankle Rotations:* Tatkar (footwork) se pehle dono ankles ko 10 times rotate karein for injury-free practice.\n3️⃣ *Pataka Mudra Stretch:* Haathon ko stretch karke 1 minute hold karein for finger grace.\n\nKal ke live batch ke liye ye perfect warm-up hai! 🎶"
    },
